    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why should I play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you plagued by dreams? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of work?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you see corpses every day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Believe me, you are not alone. Our protagonist will share your suffering, and maybe even increase it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine a piece of the thanatopractician's life under a microscope, help him figure out his love life and his head, make the most important life choices for him, solve riddles, interpret dreams and delight your ears with an authentic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual, yet literary and musical work is inspired by life in a post-Soviet city and the need to solve unsolvable riddles every day.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why should I play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you plagued by dreams? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of work?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you see corpses every day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Believe me, you are not alone. Our protagonist will share your suffering, and maybe even increase it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine a piece of the thanatopractician's life under a microscope, help him figure out his love life and his head, make the most important life choices for him, solve riddles, interpret dreams and delight your ears with an authentic soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual, yet literary and musical work is inspired by life in a post-Soviet city and the need to solve unsolvable riddles every day.</p>",
    "short_description": "Read words and make choices as you immerse yourself in the adventures inside the protagonist's head. This dark visual novel tells the story of a lost man among corpses in a northern Russian town. Will you help the hero find a good ending? I don't know what to do with him anymore.",
